{"generated": "2026-10-30 16:45", "brief": "<b>1. TPG의 롯데렌탈 1.3조 원 인수 완료</b>\n사모펀드 운용사 TPG가 롯데그룹으로부터 롯데렌탈 경영권을 1조 3,105억 원에 최종 매각받으며 11년 만에 새 주인이 되었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNQ3ZVMFBINV9Fcld3ZDExdjV1bjgwbXdTWnVuYmtGZUNqd19Oc2NhYzhoeXY5VG9aOHE0c20zT3pWY2tuWjA5ckVMUDNrZ3JWaW10aDRxelNsYzc2M19SQmpxcEViR2ZZMzdXYUI4aS01V2ZMY0VRQ2lqdURITG9fdFRSZTUzN1Rm?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#7</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBRajR5NjMxenFxNU9WVHdHTDhrcGxkVnpZUWRoZ1pPNXpUMmZxSzJCcVlCOVpuY0RwcTc5T0xDMmg2aERZVFNVZG1OTUdSQkgySndjTkMtOHFWUnBz?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a>]. 롯데그룹은 이번 지분 매각을 통해 대규모 실탄을 확보했으며, 이를 바탕으로 그룹 재무 구조 개선 작업에 박차를 가할 전망입니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFBGbjVMVFRHVVRGUWxsd2tlWmI0WVJXY2Q1UkUwaHNBZjNBOVllc3BfVDJfaHFCS3ZHQ3N4R0J5TzZmYklXQ1pRRkpRNnB1UHM1b0dhYzdBWWoyaWVxQkVlYUhoQXhtSXNZVlJOVFJ5dXloa2pN?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1Sc0NzTjdjZTRaal9pVGdYbHFGTjFCWEY2UWhpYVVBb2R6VGJfOFdUU08zRG9NR0VYN2x0ZS1NRlptb0xndWpXM0hDX2YzZTd2bERreHlxbWVnU2dBMG9lU2ZvUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a>].\n\n<b>2. 공모주 시장 열기 속 인텔리빅스 상장 및 신규 공모가 확정</b>\n안전 AI 전문기업 인텔리빅스가 코스닥 상장 첫날 공모가 대비 3.4~3.5배 급등하며 시장의 큰 주목을 받았습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE41dWw4bW9LZGNoOGlsMDFWYUJFOGRYMFBGNDNEamU0UnlJenEyN3hqQ0t5M3l1UzZMRXl6T3QwZFlCMEtQN1NZZjBnTDFhdnFZLWI2RC1ZUVZvdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5hQzVkZXhzaWhaWnBOQ1h3dWNoVWtUUEhHZzlZbXVlcTNkX3NfRHg3TnRGM05YNmZnVWg5bE9EdVRHaTJxbXo1ZXd0Mk56d2dLaTFzNVBDWDBtZm96X0dJdl9YMHNsS28?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a>]. 한편 바로팜은 최종 공모가를 1만 6,400원으로 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFA0aTBIajFPMG1TVjNUOV9MdUdaQ3hGWTE1N3JaYURfWC0xMjdKeDcxMmFEZHdDRlZDemFFemgxbzE2ME9Ua3hjMWVBUWFhYU